    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 · Keeping the subscription alive\nRuns itself every morning at 09:00 Dubai time. No webhook, no button.\n\n**3 days before** → friendly heads-up\n**On the day** → payment link\n**3 days late** → warning, store still running\n**After the grace period** → store off\n\nThe seller never loses their page or their products — only the store switches off. That is deliberate: it keeps them on the platform, and one payment brings everything straight back.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
