        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### The one thing to get right\n`next_renewal` in the sheet must be a real date (`2026-09-21`).\n\nFlow 2 writes it on payment. If you ever activate someone by hand, write that column yourself or this flow will skip them forever.",
        "width": 420,
